# Core Project Rules

Strictly read and follow `@AGENTS.md` for the workflow and verification commands.

## Critical context & token hygiene
- Static SolidJS + Vite site; no Go module, `just` recipes, seeds or CI runner exist here.
- Avoid reading `dist/**` and `node_modules/**` unless diagnosing a failure.
- Verify with `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm build` before a PR.
- No merge to `main` or production change without explicit authorization from Christian.
